  "description": "<p>This ticket is only valid once this PR is in: <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/1357\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/1357</a></p>\n\n<p>The goal is to take the call to setContentSize() out of getContentSize() in UrlBinary.java and LocalBinary.java in fcrepo-kernel-modeshape module. </p>\n\n<p>The setContentSize() call should probably be called in setExternalContent().  </p>",
